# Everything needs the owner's review. Combined with branch protection on main,
# this is what stops a change reaching the live server without a second look --
# even when the only reviewer is the person who wrote it.
*       @REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME

# Changes to the pipeline and to production values deserve extra attention,
# since they are the two ways a mistake escapes staging.
/.github/                        @REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME
/environments/production/        @REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME
